      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_da5c4232",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: oh_look_my_new_dishwasher_arrived; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in a kitchen, looking at a newly installed dishwasher with a somewhat confused or unimpressed expression, while the text reads 'oh look my new dishwasher arrived.' The overall intent is to humorously convey the idea that the person is not particularly excited or impressed by the new appliance, possibly implying a sense of resignation or lack of enthusiasm for new purchases. The meme is not inherently toxic or harmful as it does not target any specific group or individual based on protected characteristics. However, it could be considered mildly harmful or annoying to some viewers who might perceive the sentiment as dismissive or sarcastic, especially if they are excited about new appliances. The meme relies on the juxtaposition of the visual of the man's expression and the text to create a humorous effect, but it does not contain any abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0726242d"
